Package: aquacropr
Title: Run and Calibrate FAO AquaCrop from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mohamed Jabloun", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "aquacropr@example.com")
Description: Tools for driving the FAO AquaCrop stand-alone (plugin)
    executable from R. Provides helpers to locate the plugin, assemble the
    LIST/SIMUL/OUTP working directory the executable expects, write climate
    files, parse daily output, template-render AquaCrop text files from a
    YAML parameters object, score simulations against observations,
    run DEoptim, BOBYQA, multi-BOBYQA, DDS, CMA-ES or EGO calibration, Morris / Sobol sensitivity analysis,
    and space-filling metamodel designs.
